<title>UK: Deutsche leads $1.03 billion asset-backed FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche leads $1.03 billion asset-backed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Floorplan Receivables Master Trust has issued a global issue for $1.03 billion backed by a variety of financial receivables, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT    $1.0 BLN	BASE	 LIBOR     LEGAL MAT   15.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   * 8.5 BP    AV LIFE     3 YEARS</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   ISS PRICE  *</p>
<p> NOTES    * TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>TRANCHE B</p>
<p> AMT    $31.7 MLN     BASE	 LIBOR     LEGAL MAT   15.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   * 28 BP     AV LIFE     3 YEARS</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A3/A	ISS PRICE  *</p>
<p> NOTES    * TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p>COUPON FIX WILL BE TWO DAYS BEFORE OCTOBER 16 PAY DATE</p>
<p>SERVICER IS DEUTSCHE FINANCIAL SERVICES CORP</p>
<p>THERE IS ALSO A C TRANCHE WHICH WILL NOT BE OFFERED IN GENERAL</p>
<p>DISTRIBUTION AND IS NOT RATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
